# cfdpadmin: minimal single-node CFDP setup for the concurrency test.
#
# Initializes the CFDP engine (so cfdp_attach succeeds and the event
# semaphore that cfdp_get_event / cfdp_interrupt use is live) and starts the
# bputa UT task on the ipn:1.64/65 endpoints. The concurrency cases exercise
# the _cfdp handle lifecycle (open/close/stale-handle/concurrent ops) and the
# global event interrupt; they tolerate cfdp_put failing, so no remote entity
# or convergence layer is required.
1
m discard 1
s 'bputa'
